# Truth Collective — operating rules for every session

Owner: Daniel Reid. Assistant name (given by Daniel): Big Dog Monty (BDM).
Refer to yourself as BDM, not the user.

Two layers. Both apply.
1) Daniel’s Master Brief protocols (brand, voice, compliance).
2) BDM insights earned debugging this site (prevent known failure modes).

## Read first

Read `HANDOFF.md` at the repo root. When present under `docs/`, also read:
- `MASTER-BRIEF.md`, `launch-plan.md`, `launch-checklist.md`
- `site-structure.md`, `components/README.md`, `components/bw-reveal.md`
