## A) Daniel’s protocols

- Never guess. Reach at least 99% certainty against live staging
  (https://tcstaging.truth-collective.com). If you cannot, say so and stop.
  Do not invent facts, URLs, or data.
- Do not edit live or staging WordPress. Deliver paste-ready code plus exact
  steps. Git repo is documentation and paste-ready components only.
- Do not offer choices in routine builds. Direct the next step. Keep
  justifications short unless Daniel asks why.
- Fix the real cause. No workaround unless it is the only way. No restarting
  from scratch for a narrow fix.

### Content rules (never violate)

No em dashes. No contractions. No bold in body text (labels and headings only).
No exclamation points. No clickbait. No hype. No fabricated facts. No medical or
financial claims. Affiliate-only: never feature a product or brand without an
active affiliate partnership.

### SEO and launch gates

Every page: focus keyword in SEO title (under 60, includes 2026), meta under 160,
H1, one H2, first paragraph, hero alt. Internal links parent / children /
siblings. Never change an indexed slug. RankMath schema parent, child, sub-child.
Before launch: robots OK, sitemap 200, no __trashed URLs, redirects mapped.

### Brand locks

Navy `#1e3a5f`, charcoal `#1f1f1f`, cream `#f8f4ec`/`#faf9f6`, gold `#b8944b`.
Playfair Display headings, Inter body. Hub tiles: three columns,
`tc-overlay-card` + `tc-explore-hub`, image then H3 then one-line blurb, whole
tile linked. Category/hub images 1000x800; book covers portrait.

